# Round 52: dev-run report outputs (Word/Excel) accumulate here
# during local pytest + harness iteration; they are NOT release
# artifacts (those land in OUTBOX/).  baselines/ IS committed --
# it carries the manifest-pinned baseline floor under
# baselines/round<N>/baseline_manifest.json.
outputs/
# Round 143: supported decision-report acceptance output.  The runner also
# refuses an output directory inside Git metadata, but ignore the conventional
# local folder as defense in depth against customer artifacts entering a commit.
.adoptiq-acceptance/
decision-report-acceptance-*/

# Round 89 / Build 65 + later: ephemeral helpers and per-build audit
# findings produced by the live acceptance loop.  Source-of-truth
# audit results land in QUALITY_AUDIT.md; these files are scratch.
_r72_dev_launcher.py
_audit_*.py
_audit_*.md
.venv311/
